[
    {
        "id": 1,
        "speaker": "",
        "text": "下腹部一陣尖銳的抽痛，像是有人拿著錐子在裡面攪動。",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG1.png",
        "character": "",
        "nextText": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 2,
        "speaker": "",
        "text": "這種醒來的方式既不浪漫也不壯烈，甚至有點猥瑣。",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG1.png",
        "character": "",
        "nextText": 3
    },
    {
        "id": 3,
        "speaker": "",
        "text": "趴在桌上睡了不知道多久，半張臉被壓得發麻，口水在手臂上乾掉後留下一層緊繃的薄膜。",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG1.png",
        "character": "",
        "nextText": 4
    },
    {
        "id": 4,
        "speaker": "主角",
        "text": "「哀」",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG1.png",
        "character": "docs/LN_CH1.png",
        "nextText": 5
    },
    {
        "id": 5,
        "speaker": "",
        "text": "猛地從書桌上撐起身體，動作太大，手肘似乎撞倒了桌邊空的寶特瓶。",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG1.png",
        "character": "",
        "nextText": 6
    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "speaker": "",
        "text": "但現在這些顯得不慎重要。",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG1.png",
        "character": "",
        "nextText": 7
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "speaker": "",
        "text": "推開房門躡手腳地走過父母的房門，隔著木門，還是能隱約聽到父親沉重的鼾聲。",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG1.png",
        "character": "",
        "nextText": 8
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "speaker": "",
        "text": "進了廁所，很順手的按了開關。",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG2.png",
        "character": "",
        "nextText": 9
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "speaker": "",
        "text": "尿液撞擊馬桶水的聲音在寂靜的深夜裡大得嚇人。",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG2.png",
        "character": "",
        "nextText": 10
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "speaker": "",
        "text": "走到洗手台前，下意識的撥了下頭髮。",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG2.png",
        "character": "",
        "nextText": 11
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "speaker": "主角",
        "text": "「啊」",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG2.png",
        "character": "docs/LN_CH2.png",
        "nextText": 12
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "speaker": "",
        "text": "抬頭看向鏡子。",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG2.png",
        "character": "",
        "nextText": 13
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "speaker": "",
        "text": "鏡子裡的那顆平頭，不是平常的樣子，是下午三點半之後的那個我。",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG2.png",
        "character": "",
        "nextText": 14
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "speaker": "",
        "text": "回到房間躺回床上，閉上眼睛，試著在那種規律的鼾聲中，最後一次抓住這個平凡得要命的自由。",
        "image": "docs/LN_BG1.png",
        "character": ""
    }
]